    {
      "dot": "emerald", "title": "Workout to points",
      "items": [
        "POST /workouts runs anti-cheat, then saves the workout and its outbox event in one transaction",
        "The worker drains the outbox: scoring and ledgers, challenges, live battle scores, push",
        "Live events travel worker → PostgreSQL NOTIFY → gateway; the app keeps polling as a fallback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber", "title": "Rust backend",
      "items": [
        "Replaces apps/api part by part: today health, reference lists, accounts and admin sign-in",
        "No client calls :3100 yet: the app and admin panel still call the NestJS API on :3000",
        "Own MariaDB and Redis; email goes through the same SMTP server"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate", "title": "Not drawn",
      "items": [
        "apps/landing: static marketing site with no API calls",
        "Google / Apple sign-in: the API checks app-supplied ID tokens against their JWKS",
        "docker-compose gives the NestJS API a REDIS_URL, but its code never uses Redis",
